{"timestamp": 1779344998.051411, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 18, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779345015.128049, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I reported Diana\u2019s body in electrical. My route was oxygen \u2192 upper engine \u2192 lower engine \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical. I saw Diana early in upper engine around ticks 3-5, then didn\u2019t see her again until her body in electrical. I also saw Bob in storage around 13-14 and then in medbay at 17, which is right next to electrical. I didn\u2019t see Frank at all, but he\u2019s dead too. Bob was the only person I crossed paths with near the end before I found Diana."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345028.933509, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I started in medbay, went up to upper engine, then lower engine, and ended in storage. I didn\u2019t physically run into anyone in my rooms, and I didn\u2019t see any bodies on that route. The only movement I caught was Diana leaving upper engine toward oxygen around tick 6, which lines up with Eve saying she saw Diana early in upper engine.\n\nI never saw Frank at all. Eve\u2019s info puts Bob in storage around 13-14 and medbay at 17, which is pretty close to electrical where Diana was found, so Bob needs to explain that route clearly. I don\u2019t have enough to hard accuse yet, but Bob is definitely the main person to hear from."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345051.464415, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I was mostly on the right side this round: started weapons, went through security/cams area, then back up through weapons/cafeteria and toward medbay/electrical late.\n\nI saw Frank early \u2014 he was in security around ticks 3-4, then I saw him again in weapons around tick 6, alive. After that I never saw him again, so I can\u2019t say where he died.\n\nLate round, I did see Diana in electrical around tick 15. She was alive when I saw her. I didn\u2019t see Eve at that exact moment, and I didn\u2019t see a body then. If Eve found Diana in electrical shortly after, that kill had to be pretty recent. Eve saying Bob was storage around 13-14 and medbay around 17 is important because that\u2019s right on the route into electrical. Bob definitely needs to explain what he was doing there and whether he saw Diana or anyone else."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345070.3060842, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "My route was upper engine \u2192 lower engine \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay. I never went into electrical this round.\n\nI saw Diana alive in upper engine at ticks 3-4 when she came in from lower engine. Later I saw Eve enter lower engine from upper around tick 7, then Eve came into storage from lower engine around tick 12. Eve and I were together in storage around ticks 12-14. After that I went to medbay and stayed there.\n\nThe big thing: at tick 17 I saw Eve come into medbay from storage and then go toward electrical, and then she reports Diana in electrical. Alice says Diana was alive in electrical at tick 15, so the kill had to be very recent. I was in medbay, yes, but I did not enter electrical. Eve was the one I saw actually going from medbay into electrical right before the report.\n\nSo from my perspective, Eve\u2019s report could definitely be a self-report, or she at least had the most direct opportunity on Diana. I can\u2019t explain Frank, but on Diana specifically, Eve\u2019s timing looks worse than mine."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345096.120237, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Bob\u2019s story is leaving out the key point: I saw him in medbay at tick 17, which is directly connected to electrical where Diana\u2019s body was. Alice says Diana was alive in electrical at tick 15, so the kill window is basically right then.\n\nI went from medbay into electrical and immediately found/report the body. Bob saying \u201cI never entered electrical\u201d is just his word \u2014 he was the closest person I saw to the body right before the report. I agree I had to pass through medbay, but I\u2019m the one who reported instantly. Bob had the same access and is trying to turn that on me.\n\nAlice also has important info because she saw Diana alive in electrical at 15, but Bob is still my strongest suspect from proximity and timing."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345120.281376, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My info hasn\u2019t changed: I was medbay \u2192 upper engine \u2192 lower engine \u2192 storage, and I didn\u2019t directly see Bob, Eve, Alice, or any bodies. The only thing I saw was Diana leaving upper engine toward oxygen around tick 6, which fits the early Diana sightings.\n\nFor Diana, the real kill window is after Alice saw her alive in electrical around tick 15. That narrows it to Bob or Eve, because both were in/through medbay right before the report. Bob says he stayed in medbay and Eve went into electrical; Eve says she went in and immediately reported, and Bob had access too.\n\nI\u2019m not clearing either of them, but I think the key difference is Eve is the one who actually went into electrical and reported right after the supposed kill window. That can be honest reporting, but it also can be a self-report. Bob being in medbay is suspicious, but if nobody saw him actually enter electrical, the direct opportunity sounds a bit stronger on Eve.\n\nAlso, Frank dying is still unexplained \u2014 Alice is the only one who saw him early on the right side, but her Diana timing info seems useful and consistent. Right now my vote is leaning Eve unless Alice has a stronger read."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345144.959906, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I\u2019m still leaning Eve here, mostly because of the exact timing.\n\nTo be clear on my part: I saw Diana alive in electrical around tick 15. I didn\u2019t see Bob or Eve in the room with her at that moment. I backed out through medbay after that, and the next concrete info we have is Bob and Eve both around medbay at tick 17, then Eve goes into electrical and reports.\n\nBob being nearby is absolutely suspicious, but Eve\u2019s own story puts her as the person who actually entered electrical right after Diana was last confirmed alive. A quick self-report fits that window really well. Reporting instantly doesn\u2019t clear someone if they\u2019re the only one who definitely crossed into the body room.\n\nFrank\u2019s death is still separate and weird \u2014 I only saw him alive early on right side, security/weapons, then nothing. But for Diana specifically, the cleanest timeline points more at Eve than Bob to me. Bob could be lying, but Eve had the most direct access and the report timing is too convenient."}}
{"timestamp": 1779345162.054475, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 18, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I\u2019ll restate my timeline because this is probably the vote-deciding point.\n\nMy route was upper engine \u2192 lower engine \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay. I never entered electrical. I saw Diana alive early in upper engine at ticks 3-4, then I saw Eve come down through lower engine and we crossed in storage around ticks 12-14. After that I went to medbay.\n\nAt tick 17, I saw Eve come into medbay from storage and then leave medbay into electrical. The report came right after that. Alice says Diana was alive in electrical around tick 15, so the kill window is very tight. The only person I actually saw go into electrical at the end was Eve.\n\nYes, I was in medbay, and that\u2019s close, so I understand why I\u2019m being questioned. But proximity isn\u2019t the same as entering the body room. Eve is the one who definitely crossed into electrical right before reporting. That looks like the most direct opportunity and a very possible self-report.\n\nI think the best vote here is Eve."}}
